{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"RightNow-AI.OpenFang","latestVersion":"0.6.9","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Open-source Agent Operating System","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/RightNow-AI/openfang/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Open-source Agent Operating System","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/RightNow-AI/openfang/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"OpenFang is an open-source Agent Operating System — not a chatbot framework, not a Python wrapper around an LLM, not a \"multi-agent orchestrator.\" It is a full operating system for autonomous agents, built from scratch in Rust.\nTraditional agent frameworks wait for you to type something. OpenFang runs autonomous agents that work for you — on schedules, 24/7, building knowledge graphs, monitoring targets, generating leads, managing your social media, and reporting results to your dashboard.","name":"OpenFang","packageUrl":"https://www.openfang.sh/","publisher":"RightNow AI, Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.rightnowai.co/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/RightNow-AI/openfang/releases/tag/v0.6.9","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claw","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"开源智能体操作系统","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"OpenFang 是一个开源的智能体操作系统——不是聊天机器人框架，不是围绕大语言模型的 Python 包装器，也不是“多智能体协调器”。它是一个从零开始用 Rust 构建的完整自主智能体操作系统。\n传统的智能体框架需要等待你输入指令。而 OpenFang 运行的自主智能体可以持续为你工作——按计划全天候运行，构建知识图谱、监控目标、生成线索、管理社交媒体，并将结果汇报到你的仪表盘。","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","聊天机器人","自主智能","龙虾"]}},"longDescription":"OpenFang is an open-source Agent Operating System — not a chatbot framework, not a Python wrapper around an LLM, not a \"multi-agent orchestrator.\" It is a full operating system for autonomous agents, built from scratch in Rust.\nTraditional agent frameworks wait for you to type something. OpenFang runs autonomous agents that work for you — on schedules, 24/7, build